    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d90">

                <pb facs="0096" n="90" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg90"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 91.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-01-10"><hi rendition="#italic">January 10, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received March 1.)</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith a clipping from the
                    North China News of the 20th ultimo, which is a translation of an imperial
                    decree issued in honor of those who distinguished themselves at the Yalu naval
                    battle.</p>
                <p>It will be seen that a returned American student, Ch’en Chin-k’uei, was accorded
                    high posthumous honors.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Denby.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d90-a1.xml" xpointer="d90-a1"/>
            </div>
